diff -purNx .git BPI-Router-Linux-kernel/tools/perf/Documentation/perf-mem.txt BPI-Router-Linux-kernel-6.16.12/tools/perf/Documentation/perf-mem.txt
--- BPI-Router-Linux-kernel/tools/perf/Documentation/perf-mem.txt	2025-10-22 13:53:23.691326846 -0400
